ments\n\nImage: A group of people on a grass field with a television and a trailer\n\nExclusive/From $313\n\nBluetti has switched over to its Early Prime Day power station sale, which is not only getting some special extra savings promotions but also benefits from our two ongoing exclusive codes for even lower prices. One solid option is the Elite 200 V2 Portable Power Station taken down to $759.05 shipped after using our code 9TO5TOYS5OFF at checkout, beating out Amazon by $40. You can find add-on accessory deals on the main Early Prime Day Sale\u2019s landing page here, while other power station sales from alternate brands can be found collected into our dedicated hub here.\n\nImage\n\nEcoFlow\u2019s Early Prime Day Sale offers up to 62% power station discounts, bonus extra savings, free gifts, rewards, more from $149\n\nImage\n\nEcoFlow 48-hour flash sale offers DELTA 3 Max power station + 20W GaN charger at $779, more from $1,249\n\nImage\n\nJackery Early Prime Day Sale offers up to 65% power station discounts + up to 10% bonus savings \u2013 all starting from $499\n\nImage\n\nJackery Early Prime Day flash sale drops 7,168Wh expanded HomePower 3600 Plus station + 500W solar panel to $3,134, more\n\nImage\n\nGrab Jackery\u2019s 3,584Wh HomePower 3600 Plus power station with/without a 500W solar panel starting from exclusive $1,399\n```\n\n**3\\. Reference ID\\:** `turn908543news4`\n\n**Title\\:** Amazon is clearing out the best solar generators and portable power stations on Prime Day\n\n**URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://www\\.popsci.com/gear/portable-power-station-solar-generator-prime-day-deals/\ue202https://www.popsci.com/gear/portable-power-station-solar-generator-prime-day-deals/\ue201\n\n**Excerpt (full)\\:**\n\n```text\nSave on solar generators and portable power stations from popular brands like Jackery, Bluetti, and EF EcoFlow. You'll be glad to have a backup in an emergency.\n\nBy Stan Horaczek\n\nPublished Oct 7, 2025 5:28 PM EDT\n```\n\n**4\\. Reference ID\\:** `turn908543news5`\n\n**Title\\:** Bluetti New Year power station sale with up to 53% discounts + exclusive savings from \\$119, Tenways CGO600 Pro e-bikes \\$1,599, more\n\n**URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://electrek.co/2026/01/12/bluetti-new-year-sale-power-stations-from-119-tenways-e-bikes-more/\ue202https://electrek.co/2026/01/12/bluetti-new-year-sale-power-stations-from-119-tenways-e-bikes-more/\ue201\n\n**Excerpt (full)\\:**\n\n```text\nReinette LeJeune | Jan 12 2026 - 11:00 am PT\n\n0 Comments\n\nImage\n\nThis week\u2019s starting Green Deals are headlined by the Bluetti New Year power station sale with up to 53% discounts alongside exclusive bonus savings starting from $119, with options like the new Elite 400 Portable Power Station back at its $1,221 low, among many others. There\u2019s also Tenways\u2019 switched-up New Year Sale that is now offering the CGO600 Pro Commuter e-bikes (belt or chain drives) at $1,599 \u2013 plus, the option to score a 180Wh range extender power bank at 50% off. ## Bluetti\u2019s New Year Sale takes up to 53% off power stations and bundles + exclusive bonus savings \u2013 all from $119\n\nRunning alongside the winter backup deals we spotted, Bluetti also has an ongoing New Year Sale with up to 53% discounts across its power stations, bundles, and accessories. One notable return is the new Elite 400 Portable Power Station at $1,221.06 shipped, after using the exclusive code 9TO5TOYS6OFF at checkout, beating out its Amazon pricing by $78. As I mentioned, Bluetti\u2019s New Year Sale is seeing exclusive extra savings just for our readers, with a general sitewide 5% savings available when using the code 9TO5TOYS5OFF at checkout, while any of the Elite 400 offers can get 6% extra savings using the code 9TO5TOYS6OFF at checkout.\n\n### Bluetti\u2019s New Year Sale Elite 400 offers:\n\n  * Elite 400 (3,840Wh) power station: $1,299 (Reg. $2,999)\n  * Elite 400 with alternator charger 1: $1,599 (Reg. $3,299)\n  * Elite 400